- Dark, highly readable text.
- A restrained accent color.
- Generous whitespace.
- Consistent spacing and alignment.
- Minimal borders and shadows.
- Subtle transitions only when useful.
- Responsive layouts for mobile, tablet, and desktop.

Avoid:

